2026-08-12: Resolution diagnostic measured clustered-unit-equivalent row bootstrap ROC AUC SE 0.000878 and sequence/hazard rank correlation 0.736837; their validation gap was 0.036186, well beyond two SE. Validation volume 409,792 was comparable to prior origins 416,981/415,013, although its positive rate 0.6420 exceeded 0.5964/0.5987; no prediction-period labels were accessed and there is no measured candidate-order inversion supporting an evaluation change request.
